##* {{RQ:KJV|Psalms|83|1|passage='''Hold''' not thy peace, and be not still.}}
##* {{quote-book|en|year=1667 |title=Paradise Lost, Book II|author=John Milton|passage=Seedtime and harvest, heat and hoary frost, / Shall '''hold''' their course.}}
